Error [jet.ClosedSetElse]: This `else` stands for cases of the closed set `Color`
  --> tests/ui/closed_else_statement_table.jet:21:9
    |
 21 |         else -> total += 100
    |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `Color` is a closed set: an `else` would take any case added to `Color` later silently, instead of the compiler asking you to handle it
 Fix: Name the cases instead: `.Green | .Custom(_) ->`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0641

